    "Depending on your runtime and model, this includes Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (Codex), xAI (Grok), Google (Antigravity), the model provider an OpenCode runtime uses (OpenCode Zen when it is not signed in to one), or Amazon Web Services. When tracing is enabled, Yu AI stores AI execution traces, which can include conversation and tool content, for diagnostics and service improvement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视你的 Runtime 和模型而定，接收方可能是 Anthropic（Claude）、OpenAI（Codex）、xAI（Grok）、Google（Antigravity）、OpenCode Runtime 所用的模型服务商（未登录时是 OpenCode Zen）或 Amazon Web Services。开启追踪时，Yu AI 会保存 AI 执行过程记录，其中可能包含对话和工具内容，用于诊断和改善服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
