        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证码 10 分钟内有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation owner can choose credentials for this conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话所有者可以为这段对话选择 Credential。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation stays here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话保留在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prompt sets the writing style and spells names Whisper doesn't know, such as products and services. Recordings are transcribed by OpenAI Whisper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示词用于设定写作风格，并拼出 Whisper 不认识的名称，例如产品和服务名。录音由 OpenAI Whisper 转写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device signed in before device management existed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备在设备管理上线前就已登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This runtime runs on your computer. After the move, people in this conversation can reply only if they can use this computer; the others can still read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Runtime 在你的电脑上。移动后，这段对话里的人必须能使用这台电脑才能回复，其他人仍可阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This submits a deletion request; it does not instantly erase your account. You can continue using your account while the request is processed. Signing in again does not cancel the request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会提交删除申请，不会立刻清空账户。处理期间你仍可使用账户。再次登录不会取消该申请。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcription prompt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写提示词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type DELETE": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 DELETE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlink": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解除关联"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Yu AI Cloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Yu AI 云端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a passkey": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用通行密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses this iPhone's sign-ins, not your Mac's.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用这台 iPhone 的登录状态，不沿用 Mac 上的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using an agent sends your prompts, conversation history, uploaded images and files, and relevant results from connected tools to the providers needed to carry out your request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Agent 时，你的提示词、对话记录、上传的图片和文件，以及连接工具中的相关结果，会发送给完成请求所需的服务商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待批准…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We will permanently delete your account and associated personal data within 30 days. Our team will coordinate any workspace ownership and shared-data handling. Records required by law and data jointly held by your team may be retained where necessary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们会在 30 天内永久删除你的账户及相关个人数据。Workspace 归属和共享数据的处理由我们协调。法律要求保留的记录和由团队共同持有的数据，在必要时会继续保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent needs you to decide something, it shows up here. Answer it and it leaves the Inbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 需要你决定时，会出现在这里。答复后就会从 Inbox 消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your account is signed in. Sign out anything you don’t recognize, then change your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里是账户的登录位置。发现不认识的设备，先退出登录，再修改密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who receives this data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "谁会收到这些数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdraw AI data sharing permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤回 AI 数据共享授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a photo, your initials are shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不上传照片时，会显示你名字的首字母。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Workspace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all caught up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部处理完了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your choice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your request has been saved. You do not need to contact support to start deletion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "申请已保存，不必另外联系支持团队即可开始删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yu AI encrypts it on its way to the runtime, which keeps it; Yu AI does not keep a copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yu AI 会在传往 Runtime 的途中加密，密钥由 Runtime 保存，Yu AI 不保留副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yu Bot is based on Nuphos, an open source project. Not affiliated with Zeabur Inc.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yu Bot 基于开源项目 Nuphos，与 Zeabur Inc. 无关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "https://nuphos.example.com": {},
